# Vendor firmware is licensed to us and must never leave the org. Nothing
# derived from the BIOSLove share belongs in this repo: not the payloads, not
# the tools, not the index that catalogues them (it carries the share path,
# every model, and every digest). Regenerate with `cargo run -p bioslove-index`.
bioslove-index/index.json
bioslove-index/index.json*
index.json.bak

# Vendor firmware payloads and flasher binaries, wherever they land.
